Abstract: Addressingtheriskassessmentissueofshieldtunnelingadjacenttobridgepilefoundations,thisstudyfo
cusedontheshieldtunnelingconstructionoftheextra-largebridgepilefoundationsforWuhan MetroLine7.Basedonthe
riskcomponentsof"hazard-bearingsystem"andtheirformationmechanism,asetpairanalysis-variablefuzzyset-catastro
